pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">Ⅰ</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가근로장학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">자격요건 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가근로장학생 순위통과자</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위확인 방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교 원스톱서비스 로그인 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생지원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근로장학생 신청서 제출 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">→</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 상세내역에 선발순위 확인 가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1·2·3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위 또는 순위탈락으로 표시됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">우선선발자 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; 2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; 3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위자가 근로배정인원보다 적을 경우만 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위 그다음 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위자가 근로선발가능</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위별 인원현황</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">[1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 588</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 139</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">순위 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 91</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">명</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가근로신청 후 서약서 미제출자 중 근로를 원하는 학생은 근로신청 후 반드시 서약서를 <font face=\"함초롬바탕\">12.22</font></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">까지 학생처</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">본관</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">101</